  "_design": {
    "notes": "Seven jumps of 26-66 frames (scrollbar drag / thumbnail click / jump-to-finding) between local reading runs. window_frames() is symmetric (center +/- k), so a max_step:1 reversal is always already inside the window emitted before the reader arrived \u2014 which is why no previous trace could produce a head-of-line miss. A jump of displacement > D/2 leaves the window and forces a cold ask with stale frames still in flight ahead of it. adr-reject-server-cancel.md lists exactly this ('jump affordance in the UI') as a flip condition for its own rejection."
  }
